  "title": "Blueberry Gelatin Salad",
  "description": "This is a recipe I discovered about 25 years ago when grape gelatin was hard to find! It&#39;s a terrific side dish or a delicious dessert. It&#39;s very rich in flavor and can be made ahead of time. Also good with cherry gelatin and cherry pie filling.",
